					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Its the last one from me for a while, probably<br /> definitely my last Jamcon<br /> hopefully i didnt mess anything up here<br /> <span style="color: white">So you ride yourselves over the fields</span><br /> Title is from Jethro Tull's <em>Thick as a Brick</em>, for those keeping score<br /> <span style="color: white">And you make all your animal deals</span><br /> Thank you, as always, to my wonderful critters: <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/alistair-hawks" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4544281&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1584394161" alt="Alistair Hawks" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4544281)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/alistair-hawks" >Alistair Hawks</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jackalrelated" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3207203&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1584394161" alt="JackalRelated" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3207203)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jackalrelated" >JackalRelated</a></span>, <span class="error-inline"><em>GibberingEloquence</em> does not match any existing user name</span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ayers" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1856789&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1584394161" alt="Ayers" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1856789)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ayers" >Ayers</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncle-nicolini" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3487700&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1584394161" alt="Uncle Nicolini" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3487700)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncle-nicolini" >Uncle Nicolini</a></span><br /> <span style="color: white">And your wise men don't know how it feels<br /> To be thick<br /> as a brick</span></p> 
